      <p source="#source-27139-27276"><seg source="#source-27139-27142">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-27142-27163"><rb>蔦屋</rb><rt>つたや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-27163-27175">さんのお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-27175-27193"><rb>孃</rb><rt>ぢやう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-27193-27208">さんに、お</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-27208-27220"><rb>目</rb><rt>め</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-27220-27241">にかゝりたくて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-27241-27256"><rb>參</rb><rt>まゐ</rt></ruby>りました。」</p>
      <p source="#source-27276-27341"><seg source="#source-27276-27279">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-27279-27294"><rb>米</rb><rt>よね</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-27294-27297">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-27297-27315"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたし</rt></ruby>でございます。」</p>
